{{ som | upper }} on the {{ carrier | upper }}
================================================================================

{{ processor }} system-on-module on the {{ carrier | upper }} carrier board.

Overview
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This page describes how to evaluate the :adi:`{{ processor }}`
with the {{ som | upper }} system-on-module (SoM) on the {{ carrier | upper }}
carrier board. The SoM carries the processor, its memories and power supplies;
the carrier board provides the peripherals and the on-board debug agent.

Recommendations
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

People who follow the flow that is outlined, have a much better experience with
things. However, like many things, documentation is never as complete as it
should be. If you have any questions, check the
:ref:`Help and Support <{{ ref }} help-and-support>` section at the bottom of
the page.

